{"parentUuid":"38fbe766-a881-4190-99bd-03ce0c238277","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"2a81cff2-a7a8-4e62-bcc6-0c023068f2b2","agentId":"a3aafe568bae89c86","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011G4s3YncrQjwUHhoKRDVZR","type":"tool_result","content":"**Why it works** — The authors give the physics: the parachutes' aerodynamic resistance \"increases rapidly with velocity (actually the square of the velocity),\" which \"allows us to use these devices more knowledgeably\" (PDF p. 255 / printed p. 244); that is why parachute size and running speed together set the load. Inference: velocity-squared drag is the textbook drag equation, and this relation is the only part of the entry that could rate `proven`; the size-to-quality mapping, distances, frequencies and progression are the authors' practice recommendations with no cited trial, so the entry as a whole is `supported`. The authors give no mechanism for why the quick-release contrast enhances stride frequency.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bbe4075f-909b-482a-ad9b-5438d7929e89","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:52:23.724Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"**Why it works** — The authors give the physics: the parachutes' aerodynamic resistance \"increases rapidly with velocity (actually the square of the velocity),\" which \"allows us to use these devices more knowledgeably\" (PDF p. 255 / printed p. 244); that is why parachute size and running speed together set the load. Inference: velocity-squared drag is the textbook drag equation, and this relation is the only part of the entry that could rate `proven`; the size-to-quality mapping, distances, frequencies and progression are the authors' practice recommendations with no cited trial, so the entry as a whole is `supported`. The authors give no mechanism for why the quick-release contrast enhances stride frequency.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"38fbe766-a881-4190-99bd-03ce0c238277"